§ `490.02915 Notice before release; notice on disposition by Review Board`

-- src:10578 | Notice before release
-- src:10579 | 490.02915 (1) The person in charge of the place in which a person who is subject to an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act is serving the custodial portion of a sentence, or is detained in custody before their release or discharge, shall give the person a copy of the Form 1 referred to in subsection 490.02912(3) not earlier than 10 days before their release or discharge.
@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(1) (src:10578-10579)
GIVEN `they are subject to an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they are serving the custodial portion of a sentence, or are detained in custody before their release or discharge, in the place` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place must give the person a copy of the Form 1` MEANS
    IF `they are subject to an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` AND `they are serving the custodial portion of a sentence, or are detained in custody before their release or discharge, in the place`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is laid on the person in charge of the place in which a person subject to an obligation under section 36.1 "is serving the custodial portion of a sentence, or is detained in custody before their release or discharge"

@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(1) (src:10578-10579)
GIVEN `the day of their release or discharge` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the copy of the Form 1 is given` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` MEANS
    IF Date (DATE_DAY `the day on which the copy of the Form 1 is given` PLUS 10) (DATE_MONTH `the day on which the copy of the Form 1 is given`) (DATE_YEAR `the day on which the copy of the Form 1 is given`) AT LEAST `the day of their release or discharge`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall give the person a copy of the Form 1 referred to in subsection 490.02912(3) not earlier than 10 days before their release or discharge"

@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(1) (src:10578-10579)
DECLARE `s 490.02915(1) party` IS ONE OF `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place`   -- not in the core's Party: NEEDS-CORE.md
DECLARE `s 490.02915(1) action` IS ONE OF `s 490.02915(1) give the person a copy of the Form 1 referred to in subsection 490.02912(3)`

@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(1) (src:10578-10579)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `s 490.02915(1) party` `s 490.02915(1) action`
`s 490.02915(1) the duty of the person in charge of the place to give a copy of the Form 1` MEANS
    PARTY `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place`
    MUST `s 490.02915(1) give the person a copy of the Form 1 referred to in subsection 490.02912(3)`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place` BECAUSE "the person was not given a copy of the Form 1 before their release or discharge"

-- src:10580 | Notice on disposition by Review Board
-- src:10581 | (2) A Review Board shall cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person when it directs
-- src:10582 | (a) under paragraph 672.54(a), that the person be discharged absolutely; or
-- src:10583 | (b) under paragraph 672.54(b), that the person be discharged subject to conditions unless the conditions restrict the person’s liberty in a manner and to an extent that prevent them from complying with sections 4, 4.1, 4.3 and 6 of the Sex Offender Information Registration Act.
@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(2) (src:10580-10583)
GIVEN `it directs under paragraph 672.54(a) that the person be discharged absolutely` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it directs under paragraph 672.54(b) that the person be discharged subject to conditions` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the conditions restrict the person’s liberty in a manner and to an extent that prevent them from complying with sections 4, 4.1, 4.3 and 6 of the Sex Offender Information Registration Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 490.02915(2) the Review Board must cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person` MEANS
    IF `it directs under paragraph 672.54(a) that the person be discharged absolutely`
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- (a)
    ELSE IF `it directs under paragraph 672.54(b) that the person be discharged subject to conditions`
         THEN IF `the conditions restrict the person’s liberty in a manner and to an extent that prevent them from complying with sections 4, 4.1, 4.3 and 6 of the Sex Offender Information Registration Act`
              THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "that the person be discharged subject to conditions unless the conditions restrict the person’s liberty in a manner and to an extent that prevent them from complying"
              ELSE JUST TRUE   -- (b)
         ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A Review Board shall cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person when it directs" [marginal (a)]

@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(2) (src:10580-10583)
DECLARE `s 490.02915(2) action` IS ONE OF `s 490.02915(2) cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person`

@ref Criminal Code s 490.02915(2) (src:10580-10583)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 490.02915(2) action`
`s 490.02915(2) the duty of the Review Board to cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given` MEANS
    PARTY `a Review Board`
    MUST `s 490.02915(2) cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `a Review Board` BECAUSE "a copy of the Form 1 was not given to the person"
